<title>USA: Nellcor to cut jobs, take charge.</title>
<headline>Nellcor to cut jobs, take charge.</headline>
<dateline>PLEASANTOWN, Calif. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nellcor Puritan Bennett Inc said it will consolidate its Home Care Business in a move expected to eliminate up to 135 jobs and result in a charge of $15 million to $20 million in the fourth quarter of fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it will close three of its six sites during fiscal 1998 in an effort to increase productivity, reduce costs and improve the effectiveness of product development activities.</p>
</text>
